msgid "Outside World visitor"
msgstr "外の世界から"

#. originKinds.lunar
#: src/data/mytu.js:16
msgctxt "text:originKinds.lunar"
msgid "Moon / Lunar Capital"
msgstr "月面・月の都"

#. originKinds.shifting
#: src/data/mytu.js:17
msgctxt "text:originKinds.shifting"
msgid "Residence moves"
msgstr "住居が移動する"

#. reviewers.reimu.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:32
msgctxt "text:reviewers.reimu.name"
msgid "Reimu Hakurei"
msgstr "博麗 霊夢"

#. reviewers.reimu.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:33
msgctxt "text:reviewers.reimu.role"
msgid "Professor of Incident Response"
msgstr "異変対応実務 教授"

#. reviewers.reimu.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:35
msgctxt "text:reviewers.reimu.note"
msgid ""
"Proceed, but incident response is not an excuse to skip exit conditions or a "
"no-Bomb constraint. If the shrine barrier breaks, the lab repairs it."
msgstr "実施は可。ただし「異変対応」を理由に退路や no-Bomb 条件を省略しないこと。神社の結界を破損した場合は研究室で修復。"

#. reviewers.yukari.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:38
msgctxt "text:reviewers.yukari.name"
msgid "Yukari Yakumo"
msgstr "八雲 紫"

#. reviewers.yukari.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:39
msgctxt "text:reviewers.yukari.role"
msgid "Founding Professor of Boundary Studies"
msgstr "境界研究 創設教授"

#. reviewers.yukari.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:41
msgctxt "text:reviewers.yukari.note"
msgid ""
"The question has reached a boundary worth studying. Approved for interview; "
"whether the interview is inside or outside campus will be defined that day."
msgstr "研究に値する境界へ到達している。面接へ進める。ただし面接が学内か学外かは当日に定義する。"

#. reviewers.keine.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:44
msgctxt "text:reviewers.keine.name"
msgid "Keine Kamishirasawa"
msgstr "上白沢 慧音"

#. reviewers.keine.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:45
msgctxt "text:reviewers.keine.role"
msgid "Dean of History and Records"
msgstr "歴史記録学部長"

#. reviewers.keine.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:47
msgctxt "text:reviewers.keine.note"
msgid ""
"Separate what happened, who recorded it, and which version was allowed to "
"remain. The current method still treats later narration as contemporary "
"evidence."
msgstr "「何が起きたか」「誰が記録したか」「どの版が保存を許されたか」を三欄に分けること。現状では後世の叙述を当時の証拠として扱ってしまう。"

#. reviewers.patchouli.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:50
msgctxt "text:reviewers.patchouli.name"
msgid "Patchouli Knowledge"
msgstr "パチュリー・ノーレッジ"

#. reviewers.patchouli.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:51
msgctxt "text:reviewers.patchouli.role"
msgid "Professor of Elemental Theory"
msgstr "元素理論 教授"

#. reviewers.patchouli.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:53
msgctxt "text:reviewers.patchouli.note"
msgid ""
"“Difficult” is not an operational variable. Separate danmaku readability, "
"control latency, route solving, and resource limits, then identify what can "
"be falsified."
msgstr "「難しい」は操作可能な変数ではない。弾幕の可読性、操作遅延、経路探索、資源制約を分け、反証可能な項目を示すこと。"

#. reviewers.marisa.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:56
msgctxt "text:reviewers.marisa.name"
msgid "Marisa Kirisame"
msgstr "霧雨 魔理沙"

#. reviewers.marisa.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:57
msgctxt "text:reviewers.marisa.role"
msgid "Professor of Applied Magic"
msgstr "応用魔法 教授"

#. reviewers.marisa.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:59
msgctxt "text:reviewers.marisa.note"
msgid ""
"If the method runs, run it. Submit three reproducible failures and material "
"provenance before the formal trial; “found in the forest” counts as half a "
"field."
msgstr "動く方法ならまず試せ。正式実験前に再現可能な失敗を三回と素材出典を提出。「森で拾った」は今回は半欄扱い。"

#. reviewers.eirin.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:62
msgctxt "text:reviewers.eirin.name"
msgid "Eirin Yagokoro"
msgstr "八意 永琳"

#. reviewers.eirin.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:63
msgctxt "text:reviewers.eirin.role"
msgid "Dean of Lunar Medicine"
msgstr "月都医薬生命学部長"

#. reviewers.eirin.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:65
msgctxt "text:reviewers.eirin.note"
msgid ""
"The question may proceed. Record lunar response separately from fatigue. "
"Housing is provisionally near the bamboo clinic route; do not follow the "
"fourth lantern."
msgstr "次段階へ進める。月相反応と疲労は別々に記録すること。住居は竹林診療経路付近を仮指定し、第四の灯りには従わないこと。"

#. reviewers.nitori.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:68
msgctxt "text:reviewers.nitori.name"
msgid "Nitori Kawashiro"
msgstr "河城 にとり"

#. reviewers.nitori.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:69
msgctxt "text:reviewers.nitori.role"
msgid "Dean of Kappa Engineering"
msgstr "河童工学部長"

#. reviewers.nitori.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:71
msgctxt "text:reviewers.nitori.note"
msgid ""
"Prototype approved. Log inputs, outputs, failure timestamps, and tape batch "
"together. If the box cannot be opened, it is not maintainable."
msgstr "試作可。入力、出力、故障時刻、テープのロットを同時に記録すること。箱が開かなければ整備可能とは認めない。"

#. reviewers.aya.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:74
msgctxt "text:reviewers.aya.name"
msgid "Aya Shameimaru"
msgstr "射命丸 文"

#. reviewers.aya.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:75
msgctxt "text:reviewers.aya.role"
msgid "Dean of Tengu Journalism"
msgstr "天狗新聞報道学部長"

#. reviewers.aya.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:77
msgctxt "text:reviewers.aya.note"
msgid ""
"The abstract belongs on page one, which is exactly why its claim must "
"shrink. Add a source chain and public-correction plan before I invent the "
"headline."
msgstr "一面向きの要旨だからこそ主張を絞る必要がある。こちらが見出しを決める前に、情報源の連鎖と公開訂正計画を追加すること。"

#. reviewers.byakuren.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:80
msgctxt "text:reviewers.byakuren.name"
msgid "Byakuren Hijiri"
msgstr "聖 白蓮"

#. reviewers.byakuren.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:81
msgctxt "text:reviewers.byakuren.role"
msgid "Rotating Professor of Coexistence Practice"
msgstr "共生実務 輪番教授"

#. reviewers.byakuren.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:83
msgctxt "text:reviewers.byakuren.note"
msgid ""
"The question recognizes costs borne by different bodies and lifespans. "
"Proceed, but include those who leave no written record in the next method."
msgstr "異なる身体と寿命が負う費用を見ている点を評価する。次稿では文字を残さない者も方法に含めること。"

#. reviewers.kanako.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:86
msgctxt "text:reviewers.kanako.name"
msgid "Kanako Yasaka"
msgstr "八坂 神奈子"

#. reviewers.kanako.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:87
msgctxt "text:reviewers.kanako.role"
msgid "Rotating Professor of Faith Infrastructure"
msgstr "信仰基盤 輪番教授"

#. reviewers.kanako.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:89
msgctxt "text:reviewers.kanako.note"
msgid ""
"The principle is sound; the resource table is not. Name who powers, repairs, "
"and receives festival priority. Faith does not generate an omitted budget "
"line."
msgstr "理念はよいが資源表が足りない。給電、整備、祭日の優先権を誰が担うか追記すること。信仰は空欄の予算を発電しない。"

#. reviewers.miko.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:92
msgctxt "text:reviewers.miko.name"
msgid "Toyosatomimi no Miko"
msgstr "豊聡耳 神子"

#. reviewers.miko.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:93
msgctxt "text:reviewers.miko.role"
msgid "Rotating Professor of Public Leadership"
msgstr "公共指導 輪番教授"

#. reviewers.miko.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:95
msgctxt "text:reviewers.miko.note"
msgid ""
"I hear eleven desires, but the application answers only three. State which "
"requests you will not satisfy and who bears that decision."
msgstr "十一の望みが聞こえるが、出願は三つにしか答えていない。満たさない要求と、その判断を誰が負うかを公開すること。"

#. reviewerCommentary.reimu.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:101
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.reimu.question"
msgid ""
"State where this becomes an incident and where it stops being my problem. "
"The question may be strange; the responsibility boundary may not simply sit "
"outside the shrine."
msgstr "どの段階から異変で、どの段階から私の担当外かを先に示すこと。問いは奇妙でもよいが、責任境界を神社の外だけに引かない。"

#. reviewerCommentary.reimu.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:102
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.reimu.method"
msgid ""
"The method needs a real way to stop, clean up, and get back to dinner. Start "
"conditions without exit conditions are not approved."
msgstr "方法には本当に停止し、片付け、食事へ戻れる経路が必要。開始条件だけで終了条件がないものは不可。"

#. reviewerCommentary.reimu.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:103
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.reimu.needs"
msgid ""
"Ask for what you need, but do not count a free venue, free repairs, and a "
"free shrine maiden as one resource."
msgstr "希望欄はいくら書いてもよいが、無料会場・無料修理・無料巫女を同じ資源として数えないこと。"

#. reviewerCommentary.yukari.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:106
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.yukari.question"
msgid ""
"The interesting part is which side the question quietly holds fixed. Bring a "
"version that still works when that assumption fails."
msgstr "この問いの面白さは、どちら側を密かに固定しているかにある。面接には、その仮定が崩れても成立する版を持参すること。"

#. reviewerCommentary.yukari.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:107
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.yukari.method"
msgid ""
"Your observation point appears to have only one address. Explain who remains "
"the observer when the two sides of that address exchange places."
msgstr "観察位置は一つの住所しか持たないようだ。住所の両側が入れ替わった時、誰が観察者のままかを示してほしい。"

#. reviewerCommentary.yukari.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:108
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.yukari.needs"
msgid ""
"Support can be approved, but near and reachable are not the same housing "
"condition. Boundary Studies reserves the right to reinterpret one of them."
msgstr "支援希望は承認可能。ただし「近い」と「到達可能」は同じ住居条件ではない。境界研究院はいずれか一方を再解釈する権利を留保する。"

#. reviewerCommentary.keine.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:111
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.keine.question"
msgid ""
"Separate the event, its recorder, and the later interpretation. At least one "
"sentence may be treating recollection as a same-day record."
msgstr "問いの出来事・記録者・後世の解釈を分けること。少なくとも一文が回想を当日記録として扱う可能性がある。"

#. reviewerCommentary.keine.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:112
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.keine.method"
msgid ""
"The method can run, but every correction must retain the previous version "
"and date. A correct answer without a version remains unsourced."
msgstr "方法は実行可能。ただし訂正ごとに前版と日付を残すこと。版のない正答は史学館では出典不明のまま。"

#. reviewerCommentary.keine.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:113
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.keine.needs"
msgid ""
"Needs will enter the record. Blank fields are recorded as not declared at "
"application, not later rewritten as always having been so."
msgstr "希望は記録する。空欄も「出願時未申告」と記し、後から「昔からそうだった」へ書き換えない。"

#. reviewerCommentary.patchouli.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:116
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.patchouli.question"
msgid ""
"The question mixes at least two quantities that can vary separately. Name "
"them before deciding which deserves magical expenditure."
msgstr "問いには独立に動き得る量が少なくとも二つ混ざっている。まず命名し、どちらに魔力を使う価値があるか決めること。"

#. reviewerCommentary.patchouli.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:117
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.patchouli.method"
msgid ""
"Observation is not a synonym for method. Add a comparison, a failure rule, "
"and the claim you will abandon if the result reverses."
msgstr "観察は方法の同義語ではない。比較条件、失敗基準、逆の結果が出た時に捨てる主張を追記すること。"

#. reviewerCommentary.patchouli.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:118
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.patchouli.needs"
msgid ""
"Equipment needs are negotiable. Put material batch, storage condition, and "
"return date in the table first. The library does not accept should still be "
"there."
msgstr "設備希望は協議可能。素材ロット、保存条件、返却期限を先に表へ入れること。図書館は「まだあるはず」を受け付けない。"

#. reviewerCommentary.marisa.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:121
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.marisa.question"
msgid ""
"This looks runnable and may blow up the original answer—good. Submit the "
"cheapest version that can fail quickly."
msgstr "この問いは実行できそうで、元の答えを吹き飛ばすかもしれない――いい。まず最安で最速に失敗する版を出せ。"

#. reviewerCommentary.marisa.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:122
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.marisa.method"
msgid ""
"You have steps; now make a record that lets someone else fail in the same "
"place. Give full provenance. Forest is not a supplier name."
msgstr "手順はある。次は他人も同じ場所で失敗できる記録が必要だ。素材出典は完全に書け。森は業者名じゃない。"

#. reviewerCommentary.marisa.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:123
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.marisa.needs"
msgid ""
"List what you want to borrow; I will say what is available and what I "
"already borrowed. If housed near the workshop, do not complain about "
"reproducible midnight noise."
msgstr "借りたい物を列挙しろ。貸せる物と、すでに私が借りている物を教える。工房近くの住居なら夜中の再現可能騒音に文句を言うな。"

#. reviewerCommentary.eirin.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:126
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.eirin.question"
msgid ""
"The question may proceed, but individual variation, lunar phase, and fatigue "
"currently share one sentence. Give each its own field."
msgstr "問いは次段階へ進めるが、個体差・月相・疲労が同じ文に入っている。三者を別の記録欄に分けること。"

#. reviewerCommentary.eirin.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:127
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.eirin.method"
msgid ""
"Write stopping conditions before dose or exposure. A participant saying "
"probably fine must not be automatically encoded as fine."
msgstr "中止条件を先に、用量・曝露を後に書くこと。対象者の「たぶん平気」を自動的に平気と符号化しない。"

#. reviewerCommentary.eirin.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:128
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.eirin.needs"
msgid ""
"Support can be arranged, but medical care, lunar load reduction, and "
"ordinary sleep-loss recovery are separate slips. If Tewi staples them "
"together, hand them to Reisen."
msgstr "希望は調整可能。ただし医療、月相低刺激、普通の夜更かし対策は別票。てゐが綴じた場合は鈴仙へ直接渡すこと。"

#. reviewerCommentary.nitori.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:131
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.nitori.question"
msgid ""
"This can become a prototype. Define input, output, and what still counts as "
"success when smoke leaves the box."
msgstr "この問いは試作できる。入力、出力、箱から煙が出た時に何を成功と数えるかを先に示すこと。"

#. reviewerCommentary.nitori.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:132
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.nitori.method"
msgid ""
"Add failure timestamp, version, and tape batch. Machines documented only by "
"finished photos usually break between photographs."
msgstr "故障時刻、版番号、テープロットを手順へ追加。完成写真だけの機械は、たいてい写真の間で壊れる。"

#. reviewerCommentary.nitori.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:133
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.nitori.needs"
msgid ""
"Workshop space and water access can be scheduled, but maintenance clearance "
"belongs in the request. A pretty box that cannot open is not maintainable, "
"only expensive."
msgstr "工房席と水路は調整可能だが、整備空間も希望へ含めること。開かない綺麗な箱は整備可能でなく、ただ高い。"

#. reviewerCommentary.aya.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:136
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.aya.question"
msgid ""
"The question already sounds like a headline, but not a correctable one. "
"State what new evidence would force you to replace its verb."
msgstr "問いはすでに見出しらしいが、訂正可能な見出しではない。どの新証拠で動詞を変更するか示すこと。"

#. reviewerCommentary.aya.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:137
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.aya.method"
msgid ""
"Separate source, observer, and relayer. Anonymous is allowed; no source "
"chain is not. This rule also applies to my newspaper."
msgstr "情報源、観察者、伝聞者を三欄に分ける。匿名は可、出所連鎖なしは不可。この規則は私の新聞にも適用される。"

#. reviewerCommentary.aya.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:138
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.aya.needs"
msgid ""
"Mark what cannot be public before listing public needs. If left blank, I may "
"assume the space suits a headline; that is usually bad for both sides."
msgstr "公開希望の前に非公開部分を示すこと。空欄なら見出し向きと判断するが、通常は双方に良くない。"

#. reviewerCommentary.byakuren.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:141
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.byakuren.question"
msgid ""
"The question sees difference but not who bears the cost of comparison. "
"Include lifespan, body, and those unable to leave text."
msgstr "問いは差異を見ているが、比較の費用を誰が負うかがない。寿命、身体、文字を残せない者を含めること。"

#. reviewerCommentary.byakuren.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:142
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.byakuren.method"
msgid ""
"If everyone must participate identically, convenience is being called "
"fairness. Keep at least one path a different body can complete."
msgstr "全員に同じ参加方法を求めるなら、便利を公平と呼んでいるだけ。異なる身体でも完了できる経路を一つ残すこと。"

#. reviewerCommentary.byakuren.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:143
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.byakuren.needs"
msgid ""
"Support is not an attachment added after review. Put food, access, and rest "
"in the main plan or those excluded first will never appear in the results."
msgstr "支援は審査後の添付ではない。食事、通行、休息を本案へ入れなければ、最初に除外された者は結果に現れない。"

#. reviewerCommentary.kanako.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:146
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.kanako.question"
msgid ""
"The principle is large enough. Connect it to a line that supplies power, "
"water, or people. Public value does not generate electricity from a title."
msgstr "理念は十分大きい。次は実際に電力・水・人員を供給する線へ接続すること。公共性は見出しだけでは発電しない。"

#. reviewerCommentary.kanako.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:147
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.kanako.method"
msgid ""
"Name maintenance, shutdown time, and festival priority. Consensus without an "
"operating schedule is usually someone else’s overtime."
msgstr "保守担当、停止時刻、祭日の優先権を方法へ書くこと。運転表のない合意は、たいてい誰かの残業である。"

#. reviewerCommentary.kanako.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:148
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.kanako.needs"
msgid ""
"Resources are negotiable, but separate required capacity, desired capacity, "
"and capacity Kanako believes you will eventually need. They occupy different "
"budget lines."
msgstr "資源は協議可能。ただし必要容量、希望容量、神奈子がいずれ必要と考える容量を分けること。予算欄は別々だ。"

#. reviewerCommentary.miko.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:151
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.miko.question"
msgid ""
"I hear more desires than the question declares. State which will not be "
"satisfied and who will publicly say no."
msgstr "問いに書かれた以上の願いが聞こえる。どの願いを満たさず、誰が公に断るかを示すこと。"

#. reviewerCommentary.miko.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:152
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.miko.method"
msgid ""
"The method lists actions but not decision-makers. Every turn needs an "
"accountable person; everyone agreed is not a name that can be summoned."
msgstr "方法には行動があるが決定者がない。各分岐には責任者が必要で、「皆の合意」は召喚できる名前ではない。"

#. reviewerCommentary.miko.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:153
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.miko.needs"
msgid ""
"Priorities cannot first appear after conflict. Rank them now; I would rather "
"not hear eleven people simultaneously claim to be first."
msgstr "希望の優先順は衝突後に初めて現れてはならない。今並べること。十一人が同時に自分が先だと言うのを避けたい。"
